      "HOW TO USE THE PLATFORM: Government facility teams should configure their dashboards to track: life safety system compliance status, ADA deficiency log, deferred maintenance backlog with risk ranking, utility costs benchmarked against similar government facilities, and CIP project status. Set up automated reports that align with budget cycle deadlines. Use the public-facing summary feature to generate defensible records that are ready for records requests.",
